  "note": "EXPERIMENT ONLY. Nothing in Fallow.Core loads this file; it is read by CausalRouteExperimentTests and by nothing else. It was committed with the predictions of the causal-route experiment, before any of it was run.\n\nA causal route is one declared explanation of why some evidence supports an intention. A route key is an experiment-only name for one such declared meaning, and nothing more: it is not a rule id, it is not a file position, and renaming every key consistently must change nothing. Two rules that carry the same route key are declared to state the same reason. Two rules that carry different route keys are declared to be different reasons, whatever they read. Whether a declaration is right is a modelling judgment, and is tested separately by a blind annotation, not by this file.\n\nNo production vocabulary is added. Every intention, want, trait, value, belief and feeling used here is already in the shipped vocabulary.",

